h=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081280/extras/1b453a5814eac5378aed864ad3f279b8.poster.avif?t=1788860043\" width=616 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081280/extras/1b453a5814eac5378aed864ad3f279b8.webm?t=1788860043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081280/extras/1b453a5814eac5378aed864ad3f279b8.mp4?t=1788860043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Version</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, there are 5 playable classes available, along with nearly 300 diverse items, gear, and attacks to choose from and combine.. We will continue improving and updating it as we progress in our game development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
